  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Indoor air pollution can be bad for our health. Building materials, "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", can produce harmful "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "chemicals",
      "ref": "v-chemical"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in the air. But we don’t have a good way to find these chemicals. A group of scientists in Finland hope to change this. They have a special "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ": "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "worms",
      "ref": "v-worm"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "These tiny worms are "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "transparent",
      "ref": "v-transparent"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". For their study, the scientists have changed their DNA in the lab. This change makes the worms "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " a green glow when they’re near harmful chemicals. The more serious the air pollution is, the "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " the colour will be. In lab tests, the worms were able to find pollutants, such as "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "mold",
      "zh": "霉菌"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". They could even "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " harmful chemicals from cleaning products. The "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b6",
      "number": 6
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " showed good results. Sounds great, right?"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b7",
      "number": 7
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", the idea of using worms to deal with air pollution isn’t new. The worms have "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b8",
      "number": 8
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " been used to monitor heavy metals pollution in the outdoor environment. But this is the "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b9",
      "number": 9
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " time they were used indoors. The scientists hope this new method will help people know about indoor air quality better. This way, people can make their homes and offices "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b10",
      "number": 10
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " places to live and work in."
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "images": []
 },
